# Final localization model result

This directory packages the selected Pipeline24 frozen-event-decoder result.

## Headline result

- 163 held-out predictions
- 53 one-to-one correct-class matches among 108 labels
- Precision: 0.325
- Recall: 0.491
- F1: 0.391
- F2: 0.445

## Contents

- `TRAINING.md`: complete training and evaluation method.
- `labels/`: exact four class-specific training label tables.
- `metrics/`: aggregate and per-class metrics plus label-loss audit tables.
- `predictions/`: held-out event predictions and label match table.
- `figures/loo_held_out_metrics.png`: aligned overall and per-class LOO performance.
- `figures/label_loss_pipeline.png`: aligned label-retention flow and per-class outcomes.
- `figures/`: additional model-only performance and loss-audit figures.
- `models/loo/`: 37 cross-validation checkpoints and fold-specific decoder calibration.
- `code/`: exact model, decoder, configuration, audit, and plotting snapshots.
- `model_selection/`: updated-chromothripsis retraining ablation that was not selected.

The packaged models are leave-one-genome-out evaluation checkpoints, not a single deployment model trained on all labels.
